&lt;p style="margin-left: 24px; margin-right: 0px; text-align: left; text-indent: -24px"&gt;(1）当事業年度末における本源的価値の合計額&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="border-left: 0px none #000000; border-top: 0px none #000000; border-right: 0px none #000000; border-bottom: 0px none #000000; width: 120px; vertical-align: top; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px"&gt;
